q q BT 9 TL/F1 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 227.9553 25.51181 Tm T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 765.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 19 TL/F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (1. INTRODUCTION)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 741.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (1.1 Project Overview)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 679.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm (The Script-Controlled ACL project is designed to implement fine-grained record access control based on a field)Tj T* (value. An ACL is a rule that determines whether a user or group is allowed to perform an operation on a protected)Tj T* (resource. In this project, the authorization decision is not based only on who the user is; it also considers)Tj T* (information stored in the requested record.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 616.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm (For example, a policy can permit a user to read records whose department field matches the user's department,)Tj T* (while denying records belonging to other departments. Similar rules can be created for ownership, project code,)Tj T* (region, classification, status, or another business field. The script evaluates the condition before the requested)Tj T* (record is exposed.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 567.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm (The proposed workflow is: authenticate the user )Tj/F3 9.5 Tf <ae>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( identify the requested record )Tj/F3 9.5 Tf <ae>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( read the relevant field )Tj/F3 9.5 Tf <ae>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf T* (evaluate the ACL script )Tj/F3 9.5 Tf <ae>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( grant or deny access )Tj/F3 9.5 Tf <ae>Tj/F1 9.5 Tf ( log the decision. This creates a clear authorization boundary)Tj T* (and makes the policy easier to adapt when business rules change.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 544.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (High-Level Workflow)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 51.02362 501.8661 cm .956863 .968627 .980392 rg 0 38 493.2283 -38 re f* q 1 0 0 1 6 12 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 14.28608 4.5 Tm (User Request)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 104.6457 12 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 13.22208 4.5 Tm (Authentication)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 203.2913 12 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 12.30533 4.5 Tm (Record + Field)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 301.937 12 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 20.62258 4.5 Tm (ACL Script)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 400.5827 12 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 16.92708 4.5 Tm (Allow / Deny)Tj T* ET Q q .321569 .427451 .509804 RG 1 J 1 j .8 w 0 38 m 493.2283 38 l S 0 0 m 493.2283 0 l S 0 0 m 0 38 l S 493.2283 0 m 493.2283 38 l S .603922 .666667 .721569 RG .5 w 98.64567 0 m 98.64567 38 l S 197.2913 0 m 197.2913 38 l S 295.937 0 m 295.937 38 l S 394.5827 0 m 394.5827 38 l S Q Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 470.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 16 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4 Tm (1.2 Purpose)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 422.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT -.085135 Tw 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm (The purpose of the project is to demonstrate a practical method for enforcing dynamic record-level security through)Tj T* 0 Tw (a script-controlled ACL. The system aims to reduce unauthorized record exposure, provide consistent policy)Tj T* (evaluation, and make access rules easier to understand and modify.)Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 401.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm <7f2050726f76696465207265636f72642d6c6576656c20617574686f72697a6174696f6e20696e7374656164206f662072656c79696e67206f6e6c79206f6e2062726f6164206170706c69636174696f6e20726f6c65732e>Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 380.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm <7f204576616c7561746520616363657373207573696e6720612073656c6563746564206669656c642076616c756520616e64207573657220617474726962757465732e>Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 359.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm <7f2052657475726e206120636c65617220616c6c6f772f64656e79206465636973696f6e206265666f72652070726f746563746564206461746120697320646973706c617965642e>Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 338.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm <7f20537570706f7274206175646974206c6f6767696e6720666f7220617574686f72697a6174696f6e206465636973696f6e732e>Tj T* ET Q q 1 0 0 1 57.02362 317.8661 cm 0 0 0 rg BT 14 TL/F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 0 4.5 Tm <7f2050726f7669646520612064657369676e20746861742063616e20626520657874656e64656420746f206164646974696f6e616c206669656c647320616e6420706f6c69637920636f6e646974696f6e732e>Tj T* ET Q Q

